       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TSTSTAGE.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY LIMITS.
       COPY SHLPARM.
       COPY POPFCTRL.
       01 TEST-COMMAND            PIC X(65536).
       01 TEST-OUTPUT             PIC X.
       01 TEST-FAILURES           PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE ZERO.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           INITIALIZE FAKE-POPEN-CONTROL
           INITIALIZE SHELL-PARM
           SET SP-COMMAND-PTR TO ADDRESS OF TEST-COMMAND
           MOVE ZERO TO SP-COMMAND-LENGTH FP-EXPECTED-LENGTH
           SET SP-OUTPUT-PTR TO ADDRESS OF TEST-OUTPUT
           MOVE ZERO TO SP-OUTPUT-CAPACITY
           CALL "SHELL" USING SHELL-PARM
           IF SP-STATUS NOT = STATUS-SHELL OR
              FP-CALL-COUNT NOT = 1 OR
              FP-STAGING-VALID NOT = FLAG-ON
               ADD 1 TO TEST-FAILURES
           END-IF

           INITIALIZE FAKE-POPEN-CONTROL
           MOVE ALL X"41" TO TEST-COMMAND(1:65534)
           MOVE 65534 TO SP-COMMAND-LENGTH FP-EXPECTED-LENGTH
           CALL "SHELL" USING SHELL-PARM
           IF SP-STATUS NOT = STATUS-SHELL OR
              FP-CALL-COUNT NOT = 1 OR
              FP-STAGING-VALID NOT = FLAG-ON
               ADD 1 TO TEST-FAILURES
           END-IF

           INITIALIZE FAKE-POPEN-CONTROL
           MOVE ALL X"41" TO TEST-COMMAND(1:65535)
           MOVE 65535 TO SP-COMMAND-LENGTH FP-EXPECTED-LENGTH
           CALL "SHELL" USING SHELL-PARM
           IF SP-STATUS NOT = STATUS-SHELL OR
              FP-CALL-COUNT NOT = 1 OR
              FP-STAGING-VALID NOT = FLAG-ON
               ADD 1 TO TEST-FAILURES
           END-IF

           MOVE 65536 TO SP-COMMAND-LENGTH
           CALL "SHELL" USING SHELL-PARM
           IF SP-STATUS NOT = STATUS-INTERNAL OR
              FP-CALL-COUNT NOT = 1 OR
              SP-OUTPUT-LENGTH NOT = ZERO OR
              SP-TRUNCATED NOT = FLAG-OFF
               ADD 1 TO TEST-FAILURES
           END-IF

           IF TEST-FAILURES = ZERO
               DISPLAY "PASS SHELL STAGING"
               MOVE ZERO TO RETURN-CODE
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "FAIL SHELL STAGING"
               MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
           END-IF
           GOBACK.

       END PROGRAM TSTSTAGE.
